{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for EchoGuard: CyberPrivacy Nexus', 'description': "Primary container for EchoGuard: CyberPrivacy Nexus implementation: A modern, visually rich, and dynamic web and mobile application focused on privacy, cybersecurity, and user awareness. Features include smart dashboards, real-time data insights, and futuristic UI elements.Design a modern, visually rich and dynamic web and mobile application called EchoGuard – AI-Based Digital Footprint Protector. The app should prioritize privacy, cybersecurity, and user awareness, and include smart dashboards, real-time data insights, and futuristic UI elements.\n\n✨ Design Requirements:\nUse a dark mode first interface with vibrant accent colors (electric blue, neon green, or purple).\n\nClean, modern UI with interactive cards, graphs, badges, and real-time widgets.\n\nDashboard should use charts, heatmaps, and visual scores.\n\nInclude motion effects for transitions (Framer Motion or similar).\n\n🧠 Key Features to Implement:\nReal-Time Exposure Dashboard – Displays user's data risk score with visuals (radar chart, gauges, progress bars).\n\nAI Privacy Action Generator – Daily/weekly tips and dynamic action plans with checklists and status indicators.\n\nDigital Twin Scanner – Visual identity maps showing where similar profiles/images are detected.\n\nPrivacy Behavior Badges – Gamified UI showing earned badges and suggestions for improvement.\n\nDark Web Leak Alerts – Timeline of data breaches impacting the user with severity indicators.\n\nThird-Party App Audit – Card-style interface showing connected apps, their trust rating, and revoke option.\n\nSocial Graph Risk Map – Interactive map of your contacts and their potential impact on your exposure.\n\nData Disintegration Tool – Elegant scheduling interface to automate deletion of outdated content or files.\n\nCustom Privacy Manifesto Generator – A form-based UI that produces a downloadable PDF summary of user privacy preferences.\n\nResponsive Multi-Device Sync – Cross-device interface with seamless UX across mobile and desktop.\n\n📱 UI Components Required:\nSidebar with tabs (Dashboard, Action Plan, Digital Twin, Alerts, Settings)\n\nHeader bar with user avatar, notifications, and device sync indicator\n\nCustom badge display and animation for achieving privacy milestones\n\nUse of Tailwind CSS + ShadCN UI components for fast, clean layout\n\nSupport for dark/light mode toggle, mobile responsiveness\n\nInclude animations, cards, sliders, timeline views, modals, progress rings, and alert banners.", 'interfaces': [], 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "EchoGuard: CyberPrivacy Nexus-44097 frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Dark Mode First UI",\n      "description": "Implement a dark mode interface with vibrant accent colors.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Interactive Dashboard",\n      "description": "Real-time data visuals including charts, heatmaps, and visual scores.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Motion Effects",\n      "description": "Use Framer Motion or similar for smooth transitions.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Responsive Design",\n      "description": "Ensure seamless UX across mobile and desktop.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "UI Components",\n      "description": "Sidebar, header, badges, widgets, and interactive cards.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Real-Time Data Processing",\n      "description": "Handle real-time data streams and updates.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "AI Integration",\n      "description": "Generate privacy tips and action plans dynamically.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Security & Authentication",\n      "description": "OAuth, JWT, and user session management.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Data Storage & Management",\n      "description": "Store user profiles, breach data, app permissions, and badges.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#8A2BE2",\n    "secondary": "#00FF7F",\n    "accent": "#00BFFF"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "Modern, clean, and futuristic layout with side navigation and top header.Pages & Components:\\n1. Login & Onboarding\\nOAuth + email login\\n\\nOnboarding wizard with 3 setup steps (permissions, device sync, goal selection)\\n\\n2. Dashboard\\nExposure Score card (radial chart)\\n\\nWeekly trend graph\\n\\nReal-time alerts panel\\n\\nDaily privacy tip widget\\n\\n3. AI Action Plan\\nInteractive checklist\\n\\nProgress bar with streak indicator\\n\\n\\"Implement Now\\" buttons with hover effects\\n\\n4. Digital Twin Scanner\\nMatch cards (name, image, content)\\n\\nStylometric analysis (text clones)\\n\\nReporting buttons\\n\\n5. Third-Party App Scanner\\nGrid view with app logos, access level, trust rating\\n\\nRevoke & Replace buttons\\n\\n6. Social Graph Risk Map\\nInteractive contact web (use D3.js or Recharts for visualization)\\n\\nColor-coded risk lines\\n\\nTooltip info on hover\\n\\n7. Leak Alerts\\nLeak cards with breach name, impact, mitigation steps\\n\\nToggle to show only new/critical alerts\\n\\n8. Data Disintegration Manager\\nScheduler interface with a content timeline\\n\\nRedaction suggestion cards with \\"Edit/Delete\\" options\\n\\n9. Badge System\\nGrid of earned badges with animations\\n\\nLeaderboard component\\n\\nXP bar and rewards meter\\n\\n10. Settings\\nDevice sync status\\n\\nReport download options (PDF)\\n\\nAI privacy behavior toggle\\n\\nEnsure consistent animations, responsive layout, clean data visuals, and accessible UX.\\n\\n"\n}', 'containers': [{'container_